silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_18_free_monad_whitepaper_yoneda_embedding_sections_03_yoneda_embedding_full_and_faithful_local_concrete_anchor_8_vetclassifies#vet_classifies silm:hasLongDescription "The vet_classifies is the vet typed verb-arrow taking Mittens to Cat (classification leg c). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'vet_classifies', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
